# Waypoint sequence management. Subcommands:
#   list                       -> list waypoint names
#   remove <name>              -> delete a waypoint
#   rename <old> <new>         -> rename a waypoint
#   reorder <name> <index>     -> move waypoint to 0-based index
#   clear                      -> delete all waypoints
#   save <filename>            -> save to waypoint_dir/<filename>.yaml
#   load <filename>            -> replace sequence with file contents
string cmd
string arg
---
bool success
string message
